{"title":"Devious Son Of Heaven","synopsis":"Chu Xiu yang berasal dari Planet Biru menyeberang ke benua selestial seratus tahun yang lalu\nmengaktifkan Sistem Penjahat yang ditakdirkan Surgawi memenggal kepala putra dan putri suci yang tak terhitung jumlahnya dari tanah suci\ndan membunuh jalannya menuju tak terkalahkan di antara rekanrekannya\nPada akhirnya dia dikelilingi oleh generasi tertua dan mati karena penghancuran diri\ndan terlahir kembali sebagai murid tertua dari Puncak Yunxia di Tanah Suci Tai Su\nKali ini dia memutuskan untuk menjalaninya dan mengembangkannya secara diamdiam\nBagaimana kalau menetapkan tujuan kecil dulu menjadi anak orang suci yang dikagumi semua orang","alternative_title":"Master: This Villainous Disciple Is Not The Holy Child","author":"原点格子工作室, 枫七月","artist":"番茄小说","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"91c7e9a5-39ff-4bdb-a762-2b3f5b3a75fa","number":"173","title":"Chapter 173","date":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"id":"c1af1e4c-ab7b-4c28-9258-aee3f2a5d5de","number":"172","title":"Chapter 172","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"fc9f3be0-b0ac-42a1-9f9d-1cf15349e6b0","number":"171","title":"Chapter 171","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"id":"538bfb00-17a0-4cd4-ba63-71d6810c11fa","number":"170","title":"Chapter 170","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"c91b15b5-c165-4b40-8eea-c70e901b1c33","number":"169","title":"Chapter 169","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"dc3303fb-4708-4deb-a037-8de8959d9c0c","number":"168","title":"Chapter 168","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"34475ba7-b422-4e0f-bf58-de2c6d079932","number":"167","title":"Chapter 167","date":"2026-05-21","images":[]},{"id":"738486b8-9403-4a74-a416-dc3cac53cf93","number":"166","title":"Chapter 166","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"id":"0618114b-8f42-4a4e-a4df-5dd4d9c1b97e","number":"165","title":"Chapter 165","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"id":"2db9684e-a713-43ce-b05f-66e5dcf23a98","number":"164","title":"Chapter 164","date":"202